hotspot-share (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial professional store release for Ubuntu and Debian.
  * Modular backend with zero external Python dependencies.
  * Native GTK3/WebKit launcher with system tray and notification support.
  * PIN pairing security and NetworkManager Wi-Fi hotspot management.

